    ## Primitive registry (13)
    
    The following primitive names are valid in `compute[*].prim`:
    
    `abs_diff`, `div`, `to_number`, `sum_col`, `count`, `column`,
    `first`, `get`, `dedupe`, `concat`, `all_true`, `any_true`, `filter_rows`
    
